## next-desireds.soar -- thor-soar: 1 proposal, 1 compare, 1 application.

## Propose next-desireds.
sp {thor-soar*propose*next-desireds
    :default
   (state <s> ^desireds <desireds1>
              ^<< required-success success >> <desireds1>)
   (<desireds1> ^next-desireds <desireds2>)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <op> + =, <)
   (<op> ^name next-desireds)
}

## Apply next-desireds -> sets desireds.
sp {apply*next-desireds
    :default
   (state <s> ^operator.name next-desireds
              ^desireds <desireds1>)
   (<desireds1> ^next-desireds <desireds2>)
-->
   (<s> ^desireds <desireds1> -
                  <desireds2>)
}

## Preference for next-desireds.
sp {thor-soar*compare*next-desireds
    :default
   (state <s> ^operator <op1> +
                        { <> <op1> <op2> }  +)
   (<op1> ^name next-desireds)
   (<op2> ^name << create-object-state-desired goal-completed >>)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <op1> > <op2>)
}
